  "macroRenderedOutput": {},
  "body": {
    "storage": {
      "value": "<ac:structured-macro ac:name=\"info\" ac:schema-version=\"1\" ac:macro-id=\"5df5acb4-bfb6-459a-bbfc-bbb73fa94aec\"><ac:rich-text-body><p>This feature is available from V0.93-Bahmni</p></ac:rich-text-body></ac:structured-macro><p>The default print of laboratory reports can be slightly modified using the Administration section of Bahmni Lab. </p><p /><p>Login to &ldquo;LABORATORY&rdquo; from the Bahmni home page. </p><p>Go to Administration &rarr; Printed Reports Configuration. You will see a screen like this. </p><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"487\" ac:original-width=\"1402\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20210318-034835.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p /><p>Changing the Site Name will modify the header. Adding additional site info will create a subheader on the print report. The lab logo option provides an option to modify the logo printed on the top left of the print page. Here is a sample report. See the change in name of the hospital, the location and the logo on the left top. </p><p /><ac:image ac:align=\"center\" ac:layout=\"center\" ac:original-height=\"349\" ac:original-width=\"736\"><ri:attachment ri:filename=\"image-20210318-034808.png\" ri:version-at-save=\"1\" /></ac:image><p />",
      "representation": "storage",
      "embeddedContent": [],
      "_expandable": {
        "content": "/rest/api/content/2256011271"
      }
    },
    "view": {
      "value": "<div class=\"confluence-information-macro confluence-information-macro-information conf-macro output-block\" data-hasbody=\"true\" data-macro-id=\"5df5acb4-bfb6-459a-bbfc-bbb73fa94aec\" data-macro-name=\"info\"><span class=\"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconfont-info confluence-information-macro-icon\"> </span><div class=\"confluence-information-macro-body\"><p>This feature is available from V0.93-Bahmni</p></div></div><p>The default print of laboratory reports can be slightly modified using the Administration section of Bahmni Lab. </p><p /><p>Login to “LABORATORY” from the Bahmni home page. </p><p>Go to Administration → Printed Reports Configuration. You will see a screen like this. </p><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2256011271/image-20210318-034835.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1616039319910&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2256011271/image-20210318-034835.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1616039319910&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"487\" data-width=\"1402\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2257289232\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20210318-034835.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2256011271\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"7c61f6bb-5959-4860-8625-2d363bce5563\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><p /><p>Changing the Site Name will modify the header. Adding additional site info will create a subheader on the print report. The lab logo option provides an option to modify the logo printed on the top left of the print page. Here is a sample report. See the change in name of the hospital, the location and the logo on the left top. </p><p /><span class=\"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper image-center-wrapper\"><img class=\"confluence-embedded-image image-center\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2256011271/image-20210318-034808.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1616039291780&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-image-src=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki/download/attachments/2256011271/image-20210318-034808.png?version=1&amp;modificationDate=1616039291780&amp;cacheVersion=1&amp;api=v2\" data-height=\"349\" data-width=\"736\" data-unresolved-comment-count=\"0\" data-linked-resource-id=\"2257289226\" data-linked-resource-version=\"1\" data-linked-resource-type=\"attachment\" data-linked-resource-default-alias=\"image-20210318-034808.png\" data-base-url=\"https://bahmni.atlassian.net/wiki\" data-linked-resource-content-type=\"image/png\" data-linked-resource-container-id=\"2256011271\" data-linked-resource-container-version=\"3\" data-media-id=\"bb0a74e4-b070-4311-95c9-5017b4eeaf10\" data-media-type=\"file\"></span><p />",
